<% layout('layouts/boilerplate') %>
<main class="pv-wrap pv-discovery-page"><header class="pv-page-heading"><p class="pv-eyebrow">Scout · Flight &amp; transport discovery</p><h1>A clearer route for you.<br>A separate plan for your pet.</h1><p class="pv-lead">Explore transport options before you book. Passenger tickets and animal transport need separate confirmation.</p><%- include('../partials/petPhotoAccent',{photo:'babies.jpg',photoAlt:'A tan dog and a gray-and-white dog resting together on a sandy beach',photoWidth:1600,photoHeight:1273,message:'Plan the route. Keep the companions in mind.',photoNote:'An original photo from the PetVoyage family album.'}) %></header>
<form class="pv-discovery-form" method="get" action="/flights/searchFlights"><div class="pv-discovery-fields"><label for="discovery-origin">Origin country<input id="discovery-origin" name="origin" value="<%= search.origin || '' %>" placeholder="e.g. United States" required maxlength="100"></label><label for="discovery-destination">Destination country<input id="discovery-destination" name="destination" value="<%= search.destination || '' %>" placeholder="e.g. Australia" required maxlength="100"></label><label for="discovery-pet">Your companion<select id="discovery-pet" name="petType"><% [['dog','Dog · ordinary pet'],['cat','Cat'],['bird','Bird'],['other','Other pet'],['assistance','Assistance dog · separate assessment']].forEach(([value,label])=>{ %><option value="<%= value %>" <%= search.petType===value?'selected':'' %>><%= label %></option><% }) %></select></label><label for="discovery-airport">Departure airport (optional)<select id="discovery-airport" name="departureAirport"><% [['','Not specified'],['LAX','Los Angeles (LAX) · reviewed gateway'],['OTHER','Other airport · positioning unverified']].forEach(([value,label])=>{ %><option value="<%= value %>" <%= search.departureAirport===value?'selected':'' %>><%= label %></option><% }) %></select></label><label for="discovery-city">Departure city (optional)<input id="discovery-city" name="departureCity" value="<%= search.departureCity || '' %>" placeholder="For your passenger search" maxlength="100"></label></div><button class="pv-button" type="submit">Explore transport options →</button><p class="pv-fine-print">Reviewed research and external search links. No live flight API, AI generation, availability, prices or pet-space checks.</p></form>
<% if(discovery){ %><%- include('../partials/transportDiscovery',{discovery}) %><% }else{ %><section class="pv-note"><h2>Start with a reviewed example</h2><p>Current coverage is deliberately small. Try the ordinary-pet dog U.S. → Australia enquiry example; other combinations clearly show when research is missing.</p><a href="/flights/searchFlights?origin=United%20States&amp;destination=Australia&amp;petType=dog&amp;departureAirport=LAX">Explore the reviewed example →</a></section><% } %>
<details class="pv-legacy-flight-option"><summary>Legacy map-based route search</summary><p>This separate tool uses external map and route services. Its cached airline lists do not confirm current flights or pet acceptance. Choose this only if you need the previous search.</p><a href="/flights/searchFlights?legacy=1">Open legacy map route search →</a></details></main>
